Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.73,0:00:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got no place to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hide like a sneaky little rat.\NShow yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have gotten on that plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.30,0:00:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You will regret your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.47,0:00:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.15,0:01:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Where to, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.87,0:01:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,To Seoul, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.95,0:01:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.19,0:02:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.65,0:02:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,could you give me five minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.61,0:03:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Jun-ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.20,0:03:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Jun-ho, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor! I need a doctor in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.67,0:03:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My son just opened his eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.30,0:03:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,In-ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.51,0:03:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,SQUID GAME 2
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.60,0:03:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,EPISODE 1\NBREAD AND LOTTERY
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.90,0:03:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,2 YEARS LATER
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.87,0:04:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not wearing a helmet.\NYour license, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it. Isn't this entrapment?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiding to catch people is shady.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.88,0:04:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to squeeze money\Nout of broke citizens?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.34,0:04:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your license, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.77,0:04:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, can't you just let us go?\NI'm wearing one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.98,0:04:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.23,0:04:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're really hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.11,0:04:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I could charge you with obstruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.95,0:04:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a tough cookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.21,0:04:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, great picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.38,0:04:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The fine for not wearing a helmet\Nis 20,000 won. Pay it on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can I post this picture online?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.51,0:05:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you on Instagram?\NLet's follow each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.18,0:05:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.47,0:05:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where are you going? What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.31,0:05:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You can ask that stupid pig\Nfor a ride in his patrol car!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.57,0:05:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.36,0:05:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.49,0:05:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hwang Jun-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this why you transferred here?\NTo be called a "stupid pig"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.21,0:05:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.13,0:05:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like vinegar on these?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.17,0:05:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been so long, I can't quite remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.51,0:05:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Jun-ho, stop wasting your time out here.\NCome back to the Major Crimes Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, not on the onions.\NJust on the pickled radish, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.77,0:05:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,For God's sake, are you still brooding?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I've tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made enough appeals\Nto the authorities,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.32,0:06:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and I had the coast guard\Nsearch the area for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.74,0:06:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. Just eat your noodles\Nbefore they get soggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.82,0:06:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.74,0:06:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I do believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.54,0:06:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But we never got those photos\Nyou said you sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your phone is at the bottom of the sea,\Nand you don't know where that island is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Those games you said you saw,\Nwhere people got killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I've tried to make\Nthe higher-ups believe it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.72,0:06:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's just not enough evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.51,0:06:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The only evidence is\Nthe untraceable bullet in your shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.48,0:06:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And let me remind you, smart-ass.\NYou went rogue with a gun
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and suddenly turned up at death's door.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't told you this before,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.32,0:06:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but when you woke up,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,they were ready to fire you,\Nand I went out of my way to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.70,0:06:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.49,0:06:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be forever indebted to you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.33,0:06:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You sarcastic little shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.87,0:06:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we're the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.13,0:07:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Firemen fight fire with water,\Nand the police--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.05,0:07:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,"Fight crime with evidence."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. That's why I work in traffic now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.93,0:07:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,\Nwe always have clear evidence here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.43,0:07:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Running red lights,\Nspeeding, not wearing a helmet…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.77,0:07:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Our evidence is there in pictures.\NNo one can dispute it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.82,0:07:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Jun-ho, do you really not remember
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.53,0:07:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,who shot you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.28,0:08:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In-ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.25,0:08:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In-ho, why…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.55,0:08:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.85,0:08:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there's a motel here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.64,0:08:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.19,0:08:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.44,0:08:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you open or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.49,0:08:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Babe, do we have to stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.37,0:08:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The lights are off too. Are they closed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.79,0:09:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. No lights means the rooms are full.\NLet's go someplace else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.05,0:09:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have to ask? I just know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.51,0:09:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You just know?\NWhat are you, a motel expert?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.68,0:09:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously? You're a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.56,0:09:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-"A dick"…\N-You said you liked how I knew everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.02,0:09:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell me how you knew.\NDid your ex-boyfriend tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.02,0:09:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you answer me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.89,0:10:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.55,0:10:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Player 456.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.59,0:10:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking for these?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.79,0:11:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.26,0:11:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you some food and medicine.\NHow are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.43,0:11:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.64,0:11:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you don't look any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to overdo it, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.85,0:11:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll burn yourself out\Nbefore you find that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.35,0:11:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.73,0:11:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We checked all the subway stations\Non Lines 1 to 4 today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.95,0:11:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But again, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.53,0:11:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Time of search?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.24,0:11:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,From 10 a.m. to 10 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We took one-hour lunch and dinner breaks.\NWe take turns eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he knows you're onto him\Nand he's gone somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been searching for two years\Nbut found no trace of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.47,0:12:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, get more men, extend the search.\NFrom the first train to the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.10,0:12:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Check all the lines at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All the lines at the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pulling off something that extensive
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.86,0:12:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,would mean shelling out\Na ton of money on staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.83,0:12:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I was approached by him three years ago,\Naround this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.88,0:12:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If the game is still going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.30,0:12:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,he's recruiting players right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.60,0:12:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It may take another year\Nif we don't find him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.44,0:12:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah… Okay, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.57,0:12:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I… I'll make sure to find him this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.24,0:13:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.41,0:13:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Woo-seok.\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.21,0:13:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,From tomorrow,\Nwe're going to need more people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.83,0:13:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What? But how many more?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just call everyone you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.55,0:13:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-But--\N-Also, we start at 6 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't stay out drinking.\NGo home and get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.18,0:13:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,At 6 a.m.? Who'd play ddakji at--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.01,0:13:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Boss. I've thought about it,\Nbut it just doesn't make any sense--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.44,0:13:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I'm sure something is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.98,0:13:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, most of the people\Nwho owe me money
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.86,0:13:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,have disappeared over the last few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.78,0:13:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-I never got any money back…\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.82,0:13:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So you think everyone who owes you money\Nwas taken to some island
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and got killed playing kiddie games.\NThat sounds--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.33,0:13:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddamnit, I barely believe a word,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.37,0:13:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm doing this for the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.29,0:13:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If Seong Gi-hun hadn't come to me himself
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.13,0:14:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,to pay off his debt\Nand hired me for this job,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have paid you all\Nor kept the business running.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.30,0:14:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that, but--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then shut up and search\Nwith your eyes wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.10,0:14:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.81,0:14:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If we find that bastard with the ddakji,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.93,0:14:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,we will get a one-billion won reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,One billion?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.31,0:14:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.\NDo you want to believe his story now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.65,0:14:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-But--\N-Tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.74,0:14:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever finds the guy,\NI'll give you half the money. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.16,0:14:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-So 500 million?\N-That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.62,0:14:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.45,0:14:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Five hundred million won!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.37,0:15:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.91,0:15:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.66,0:15:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Same old, same old.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,When the weather is good, I catch fish.\NWhen it's bad, I catch a buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.96,0:15:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You still look great for someone\Nwho drinks every day, Captain Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Save it and put this on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a mystery island to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.02,0:15:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where can I take you today, Captain Hwang?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We've checked pretty much everywhere\Nover the past year and a half,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.32,0:15:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but you want to keep going,\Nand I don't know where else to take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.28,0:15:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, mystery island?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.74,0:15:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Some places couldn't be checked properly\Nbecause of the conditions or tide changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I've narrowed them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.42,0:16:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing, Captain Hwang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.17,0:16:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, why did I have to save a drowning man
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.93,0:16:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and put myself through all this trouble?\NI pity myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.27,0:16:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,SUNSHINE CAPITAL
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.19,0:16:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.27,0:16:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The person we're looking for
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.90,0:16:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,is this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.57,0:16:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's tall, probably over 6 ft.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.12,0:16:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a good-looking fella in a nice suit,\Nwith a briefcase in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.79,0:16:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And in that briefcase,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.25,0:16:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,he's got stacks of money and ddakji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.38,0:16:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He plays ddakji with strangers\Nat subway stations, and afterwards…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,he gives them a card like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-I can't see.\N-What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.89,0:16:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment you spot someone like that,\Ncall the number we gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.73,0:17:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.61,0:17:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hold on, I can't see.\N-Move your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.86,0:17:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please move!\N-Just a little bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.74,0:17:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.87,0:17:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here are your designated areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Group 1, Lines 1 and 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.04,0:17:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Group 2, Lines 3 and 4.\NGroup 3, Lines 5 and 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.83,0:17:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Group 4, Lines 7 and 8. And Group 5,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.96,0:17:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the Gyeongui-Jungang Line\Nand the Airport Railroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,From the first train to the last,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.96,0:17:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,search the stations one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.67,0:17:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.30,0:17:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not skip a single station.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.85,0:17:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, sir!\N-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.01,0:17:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, after searching each station,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.85,0:17:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,take a picture to prove it\Nand send it to the group chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.35,0:17:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you won't get paid.\NAre we clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.69,0:17:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, sir!\N-One last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The team that finds the guy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.24,0:17:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,gets a bonus of 500 million won.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.49,0:17:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, 500 million? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.09,0:18:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,After you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.64,0:18:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go make 500 million won!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.44,0:18:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We're heading to the subway stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.31,0:18:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be on standby at the usual spot.\NKeep me posted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.82,0:18:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.85,0:18:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,SEARCHING YONGDU STATION
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,SEARCHING OKSU STATION
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen a guy like this?\NHe's tall and…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.32,0:19:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-A man in a suit, with a briefcase.\N-I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.87,0:19:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If he flips mine like this,\Nit means I lose, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.37,0:19:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So I get slapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this. Have you seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A man in a suit\Nslapping people in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.93,0:19:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Excuse me.\N-Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.64,0:19:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.26,0:19:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Let me take a quick look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.47,0:19:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.69,0:19:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a quick check.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.19,0:19:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.03,0:19:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.65,0:19:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.12,0:20:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.87,0:20:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.25,0:20:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-One.\N-Look serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.21,0:20:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,HANGANGJIN STATION CLEAR
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.18,0:20:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-We need a photo.\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.23,0:20:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,TODAY'S SEARCH HAS ENDED
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.69,0:20:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Hwang, we're heading back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.68,0:21:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to eat something first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.83,0:21:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,For God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.05,0:21:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for another selfie.\NLet's take one now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.51,0:21:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.81,0:21:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,TODAY'S SEARCH HAS ENDED
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.78,0:22:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you this was a terrible idea\Nin this weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.95,0:22:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There are whirlpools in that area.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.91,0:22:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No one ever really goes there,\Nnot even the big boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.83,0:22:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're lucky we didn't capsize.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.41,0:22:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We almost joined the mermaids\Nlooking for that island.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.62,0:22:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.79,0:22:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I have to pull you\Nout of the water that day
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.92,0:22:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and end up risking my life\Ndoing this shit for nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.17,0:22:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm forever grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.97,0:22:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how many islands there are
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.68,0:22:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,within a 6-mile radius\Nof where I found you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.06,0:22:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There are hundreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.39,0:22:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And the currents are strong out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.22,0:22:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no telling how far\Nyou drifted with that buoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.56,0:22:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even remember which island\Nyou fell from,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,let alone the island\Nwhere they play the games.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.53,0:22:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So how in the world would we find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.11,0:22:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. It's time to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.95,0:22:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.21,0:22:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You say that now,\Nbut I know you'll be back next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.30,0:23:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving my life
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.59,0:23:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and helping me look for the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.88,0:23:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll find a way to repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.26,0:23:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.73,0:23:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sad to hear that\Nyou won't be coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.11,0:23:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come visit from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.78,0:23:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.\NCome and catch squid with me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.24,0:23:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so hard to find good crew members\Nthese days.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.45,0:23:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pay you more than\Nwhat you make as an officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.24,0:23:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how much?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.87,0:23:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's talk about that over a drink\Nwhen we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.96,0:23:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the port.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.88,0:23:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The doors are opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.35,0:23:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The doors are closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.72,0:23:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.07,0:24:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.40,0:24:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Even construction workers\Nget proper food these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.28,0:24:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just… Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.78,0:24:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You little…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.45,0:24:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making easy money down here\Nin the middle of summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.37,0:24:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Count your blessings.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.83,0:24:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot.\NGo work at a construction site then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.26,0:24:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously though.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.72,0:24:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How much of Seong Gi-hun's story\Ndo you actually believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.09,0:24:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been searching every subway station\Nin the city all summer,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.85,0:24:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but no one's ever seen the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.64,0:24:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.69,0:24:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-I've been thinking.\N-Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.27,0:24:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Seong Gi-hun may be crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.53,0:24:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but he wouldn't waste billions\Nlooking for someone who doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.53,0:24:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's onto something for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.03,0:24:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, boss. We've been searching\Nthese stations for the past two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.29,0:25:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not days, years. Two whole years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.58,0:25:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My wife says I should find that bastard,\Nget myself into the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.38,0:25:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and bring home 45.6 billion won.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.09,0:25:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone were playing ddakji down here,\Nwe would've found him--
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.44,0:25:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.22,0:25:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.14,0:25:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We've found the guy. It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.64,0:26:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.56,0:26:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The ddakji, slapping, and money.\NIt's just like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.27,0:26:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He's handing over the card now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.44,0:26:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.57,0:26:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonggak Station, but he's leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.95,0:26:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.58,0:26:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow him carefully,\Nand keep me updated on his location.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.24,0:26:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay on him until I get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.29,0:26:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it. I'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.48,0:26:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,JUN-HEE
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.94,0:26:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,OBSTETRICS AND GYNECOLOGY
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.66,0:26:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The phone is off.\NYou will be directed to voicemail…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.84,0:27:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Kim Jun-hee.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.51,0:27:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a Ms. Kim Jun-hee here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.06,0:27:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Park Mi-yeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.40,0:27:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.32,0:27:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.32,0:27:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.54,0:27:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry? A hundred scratchers?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.29,0:27:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Good dreams last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.28,0:28:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. He's gone into Tapgol Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.33,0:28:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.58,0:28:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not approach him. Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.04,0:28:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.40,0:28:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.16,0:29:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.82,0:29:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to be struggling,\Nliving a life with no future.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.58,0:29:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a little gift for you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.71,0:29:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.04,0:29:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.89,0:29:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You can only have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.85,0:29:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bread, or lottery. You have to choose one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.01,0:30:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,SORRY!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.72,0:30:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.35,0:30:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The coin, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.08,0:30:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Woo-seok.\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.41,0:30:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think he's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.79,0:30:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.21,0:30:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's a good guy. I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.53,0:31:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,SORRY!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.99,0:31:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.63,0:31:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.68,0:31:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.02,0:31:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.87,0:31:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How come he's not giving us one?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.37,0:32:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Beats me.\NMan, I had a lucky dream last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.48,0:32:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.36,0:32:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you throw away\Nperfectly good food like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.11,0:32:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave you a chance,\Nand you made your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.99,0:32:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not the one who threw these away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.25,0:32:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.10,0:32:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.22,0:33:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Plate number 2071, pull over.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.48,0:33:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Plate number 2071, pull over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.41,0:34:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You take this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.96,0:34:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.67,0:34:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll either beg you to let it slide
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.88,0:34:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,or complain about us hiding\Nto give people tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.84,0:34:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be unkind,\Nbut don't listen to them go on about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.51,0:34:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be polite and professional. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.80,0:34:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.23,0:34:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you were going over the speed limit.\NCan I see your license?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.54,0:34:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.88,0:34:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.30,0:34:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please follow that orange cab over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.22,0:34:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?\N-Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.97,0:35:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pay double if you catch up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.39,0:35:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.11,0:35:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you? Are you coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.86,0:35:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.61,0:35:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is a total nutcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.49,0:35:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in a cab now.\NI'll keep you updated, but hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.29,0:35:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.79,0:35:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The fine for speeding is 60,000 won.\NMake sure--
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.26,0:35:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That was quick.\NDid you do everything right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.47,0:35:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he just took the ticket\Nand drove off without saying anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.69,0:35:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's suspicious. Did you run his ID?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.52,0:35:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.77,0:35:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what he does,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.36,0:35:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but he had a lot of cell phones\Nand tablets in his car.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.24,0:36:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,SEONG GI-HUN\NNO CRIMINAL RECORD FOUND
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.17,0:36:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Turn right here.\N-All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.63,0:36:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, he's getting out!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.17,0:36:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He just got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.09,0:36:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send the address.\NCall when you arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.84,0:36:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You can drop us off here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.14,0:36:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.80,0:36:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.52,0:36:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Seong?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.77,0:36:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be here in ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.82,0:36:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we might lose him if we wait.\NLet's just get him by ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.78,0:36:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-By ourselves?\N-That's right. Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.03,0:36:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's two against one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.74,0:36:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a coward now you're married.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.49,0:36:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that\Nsomething seems off with that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.20,0:36:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, Seong told us\Nto wait until he gets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.58,0:36:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if we lose him?\NWhat if Seong doesn't give us the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.13,0:36:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-seok. It's a billion won!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.92,0:36:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll give me half, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.38,0:37:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you trust me?\NI officiated your wedding, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.81,0:37:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.27,0:37:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey, you! Stop!\N-Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.94,0:37:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.66,0:37:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.37,0:37:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come at me, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.83,0:37:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-seok…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.26,0:37:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,SEONG GI-HUN
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.10,0:37:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,SEONG GI-HUN
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.31,0:37:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Seong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.94,0:37:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.77,0:37:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to find my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.07,0:38:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.28,0:38:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not in a position\Nto help anyone at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.62,0:38:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,VEHICLE REGISTRATION SEARCH\N29H 2071
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.34,0:38:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,ISAAC CAR RENTALS\NDONGDAEMUN-GU, SEOUL
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.26,0:38:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,DONGDAEMUN-GU
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.26,0:39:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The person you have called\Nis not available.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.42,0:39:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be directed to voicemail\Nand charged after the beep.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.64,0:39:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,MR. KIM
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.76,0:39:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like the car you're asking about
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.05,0:39:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,is currently being rented by a company.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.68,0:39:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A company? What's the name?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.56,0:39:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It says, "Sunshine Capital."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.60,0:39:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The address, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.65,0:40:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to play a game now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.87,0:40:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, Paper, Scissors, Minus One.\NI trust you know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.95,0:40:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You form a shape with each hand,\Nthen take one away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.58,0:41:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The game is decided\Nby the remaining hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.29,0:41:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course,\Nthere's a penalty for the loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.59,0:41:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've seen this in movies.\NIt's called Russian Roulette.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.76,0:41:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one bullet into a revolver\Nand close it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.81,0:41:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll point the gun at the loser's head\Nand pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.69,0:41:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Your odds of death are 1 in 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.19,0:41:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your odds of survival are 5 in 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.12,0:41:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that bad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.67,0:41:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Now, let's play. On my count.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.22,0:41:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.56,0:42:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't play.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.27,0:42:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You broke the rules for the first round.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.07,0:42:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.46,0:42:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's play again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.05,0:42:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.97,0:42:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Minus one.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.27,0:42:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.19,0:42:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said,\Nyour odds of survival are 5 in 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.45,0:42:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play again.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.25,0:43:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.71,0:43:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Minus one.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.00,0:43:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting a little boring, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.76,0:43:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's reverse the odds now, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.39,0:43:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Your odds of survival are now 1 in 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.56,0:43:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.89,0:43:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your odds of death are 5 in 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.98,0:43:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's play again.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.23,0:43:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's speed it up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.99,0:43:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors. Minus one.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.24,0:43:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors. Minus one.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.45,0:43:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors. Minus one.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.20,0:43:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors. Minus one.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.91,0:43:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.16,0:44:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Minus one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.67,0:44:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad. You didn't take one away.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.94,0:44:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.38,0:45:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your win.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.55,0:45:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, can we have a talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.89,0:45:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,SUNSHINE CAPITAL
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.03,0:47:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.\NThe boss hasn't come back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.20,0:47:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Seong says he and Woo-seok
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.33,0:47:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,were following that guy with the ddakji\Nwhen he lost contact with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.12,0:47:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell would I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.67,0:47:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, gather everyone\Nand go to Daebang Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.17,0:47:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pick up some weapons from the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.37,0:47:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.74,0:47:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I said Daebang Station, you idiot.\NNot Sindaebang.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.79,0:47:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me\Nkeep repeating myself, blockhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.96,0:48:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I said! Call everyone now!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.21,0:48:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddamn idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.08,0:48:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,IOU
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.54,0:48:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,SEONG GI-HUN
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.63,0:48:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,CERTIFICATE OF BUSINESS REGISTRATION\NPINK MOTEL
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.31,0:48:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I found bloodstains there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.97,0:48:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they didn't get far\Nfrom that alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.89,0:49:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Check all the CCTV and dashcam footage\Nyou can collect from the area
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.52,0:49:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and keep asking around.\NI'll join you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.10,0:49:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, Mr. Seong Gi-hun.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.74,0:49:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You should've gotten\Non that plane that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.16,0:49:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I changed my mind when I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.67,0:50:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like\Nyou've been trying hard to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.05,0:50:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.34,0:50:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank me?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.97,0:50:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,For inviting me to the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.73,0:50:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I won
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.11,0:50:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and made it out with a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.03,0:50:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The decent thing to do\Nwould be to thank you for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.16,0:50:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a messenger\Nwho delivers invitations.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.41,0:50:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who had you deliver those invitations?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.21,0:50:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me meet him. I have something to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.63,0:50:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the message,\Nand I'll pass it along.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.55,0:50:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not something I can discuss\Nwith an underling like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.01,0:50:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You prey on people\Nwho are hanging by a thread
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.51,0:50:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and con them at subway stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.52,0:51:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone like you wouldn't be able\Nto understand what I'm trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.31,0:51:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Seong.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.57,0:51:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you think I got to where I am now?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.70,0:51:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how you became their dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.20,0:51:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.01,0:51:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to work in the games\Nwhen I was younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.43,0:51:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I removed and burned the bodies\Nof countless people like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.35,0:51:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,"These things aren't human."
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.43,0:51:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"They're just trash,\Nutterly useless in this world."
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.61,0:51:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept telling myself that\Nand worked hard for a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.40,0:51:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they gave me a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.32,0:52:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It felt pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.91,0:52:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Like my existence was acknowledged\Nfor the first time in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.92,0:52:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know which year it was,\Nbut one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.13,0:52:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I was about to shoot a man\Nwho had lost a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.68,0:52:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy seemed familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.14,0:52:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess who it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.48,0:52:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.99,0:52:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad was suddenly\Nstanding right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.49,0:52:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He was in tears,\Ndesperately begging me to spare his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.29,0:52:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I shot him right in the middle\Nof his forehead, and realized,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.71,0:52:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ah."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.55,0:52:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'm cut out for this job."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.55,0:53:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether you shoot people in there
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.72,0:53:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,or con them outside,\Nit doesn't change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.10,0:53:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You have always been…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.78,0:53:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing more than their dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.07,0:53:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Seong.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.49,0:53:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you're special\Nbecause you won the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.66,0:53:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone like you
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.17,0:53:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,could never know…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.55,0:53:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,or understand
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.88,0:53:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,how I made it out of there alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.43,0:53:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And how it feels…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.52,0:53:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,to play the games.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.45,0:54:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.34,0:54:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've seen this in the movies.\NIt's called Russian Roulette.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.55,0:54:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Usually, you place one bullet in the gun,\Nspin the cylinder,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.14,0:54:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.19,0:54:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And before the next round,\Nyou spin the cylinder again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.15,0:54:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It resets the odds back to 1 in 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.24,0:54:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'd like to make\Nthis game a little more serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.74,0:54:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're special, Mr. Seong.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.04,0:54:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut to the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.87,0:54:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take turns pulling the trigger\Nwithout spinning the cylinder again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.84,0:55:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullet will be fired within\Nsix attempts, and the game will be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.59,0:55:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.86,0:56:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always wondered
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.94,0:56:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,how you made it out of there alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.78,0:56:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,For one thing,\Nyou were even terrible at ddakji.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.79,0:56:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.83,0:56:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your mind starting to race?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.21,0:57:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your odds of death are 1 in 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.09,0:57:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pretty high indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.93,0:57:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're afraid.\NLots going through your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.89,0:57:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me guess\Nwhat you're thinking right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.73,0:57:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,"The gun is in my hand."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.52,0:57:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,"Screw the rules.\NPull the trigger once or twice,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.23,0:57:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can blow this guy's face off."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.69,0:57:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.91,0:57:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to meet the person\Nyou mentioned earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.87,0:57:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the key is in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.24,0:57:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can simply shoot me\Nwith that gun and take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.20,0:57:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll have you admit one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.67,0:57:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That you're a piece of trash,\Njust like everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.43,0:57:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A piece of trash who got lucky\Nand made it out of the dumpster.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.85,0:58:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.81,0:58:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your mind starting to race?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.77,0:58:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.28,0:58:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.61,0:58:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, with a single pull of the trigger,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.28,0:58:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,you could kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.54,0:59:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.92,0:59:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have you admit one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.54,0:59:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You put a mask over your face
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.01,0:59:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and do whatever your master says.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.39,0:59:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You run, bark,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.06,0:59:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and wag your tail for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.85,0:59:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing more than their dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.18,1:02:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Subtitle translation by: Yoonjung Song
